<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>New User Registration</title>
  <style>
      body {
          font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
          line-height: 1.6;
          color: #333333;
          max-width: 600px;
          margin: 0 auto;
          padding: 20px;
      }
      .header {
          border-bottom: 2px solid #4285f4;
          padding-bottom: 10px;
          margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .section-title {
          background-color: #f2f2f2;
          padding: 8px;
          font-weight: bold;
          margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .info-table {
          width: 100%;
          border-collapse: collapse;
          margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .info-table td {
          padding: 8px;
          border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
      }
      .info-table td:first-child {
          font-weight: bold;
          width: 40%;
      }
      .action-items {
          background-color: #f9f9f9;
          padding: 15px;
          margin-bottom: 20px;
          border-left: 4px solid #4285f4;
      }
      .checkbox {
          margin-right: 10px;
      }
      .footer {
          font-size: 12px;
          color: #777;
          margin-top: 30px;
          padding-top: 10px;
          border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
      }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
  <h2>New User Registration: <%= @user.first_name + " " + @user.last_name %></h2>
</div>

<p>Hello Admin,</p>

<p>A new user has registered on the platform.</p>

<div class="section-title">User Details</div>
<table class="info-table">
  <tr>
    <td>Email:</td>
    <td><%= @user.email %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Registration Date:</td>
    <td><%= @user.created_at %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Job Title:</td>
    <td><%= @user.job_title %></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<div class="section-title">Action Required</div>
<div class="action-items">
  <p><span class="checkbox">☐</span> Verify user information</p>
  <p><span class="checkbox">☐</span> Assign user permissions</p>
  <p><span class="checkbox">☐</span> Approve account (if manual approval is required)</p>
</div>

<p>For any questions or concerns, please contact the IT support team.</p>

<p>Thank you,<br>
  Notification System</p>

<div class="footer">
  This is an automated message. Please do not reply directly to this email.
</div>
</body>
</html>